/* Hea Wairena the Aun Hunter - South camp hunter (Aun), marae-hunt.
 * Gives one random Aun species of the South zone, 50 kills; minimum level 100;
 * reward 400,000,000 XP (AwardNoShareXP) + 100,000 Luminance; 20 h cooldown from the claim
 * (MaraeHuntSouthAunWait). Skin cloned from 1003203 Hea Mutuona the Windreave (Setup, palette, clothing, stats; never its emotes,
 * generators, books, spells, positions or hand items). Wields Chimeric Atlatl of the Quiddity (1004712).
 * Gender (dialogue/design only - Hea Tumerok weenies carry no gender property): Male. Skins were drawn without regard to gender; swap the template if one reads wrong in game. */

